# Words Whisper hears instead of a letter of the phonetic alphabet.
# Copy this file to letters.txt (same folder) and add your own.
#
# Inside a spelled-out callsign ("Delta Echo Alpha homie November") these words
# count as the letter, so the timeline shows D-EARN. Anywhere else they stay as
# they are, so "home" in an ordinary sentence is not touched.
#
# One entry per line: the heard word (one word, any case), "=", and the letter
# word or the letter itself. Lines starting with # are ignored. Changes apply on
# the next page load; no restart needed.
#
# Built in already (no need to repeat them):
#   homie, home, romy, romio, rome = Romeo      gulf = Golf
#   killo, kilow = Kilo                         oskar = Oscar
#   charly, charley = Charlie                   leema, lema = Lima
#   eko, ekko = Echo                            foxtrott = Foxtrot
#   pappa = Papa    siera = Sierra    wiskey = Whiskey
#   juliette = Juliett    yanky = Yankee
#
# Examples:
# homey = Romeo
# hotell = H
